  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Twezimbe Maize Marketing Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: maize, Beneficiaries: 3,679 smallholder farmers (2,039 male and 1,640 female), Summary: The project will provide a storage facility to facilitate bulking of farmers produce, working capital so that farmers can access quality farm inputs and get cash on delivery of produce to the cooperative; processing equipment to add value to the farmers maize. In addition, the project will strengthen the cooperatives marketing skills in order to compete effectively with other players in the maize and beans value chains. ,</narrative>
  </description>
